<title>DENMARK: Hypotekbanken increases 2005, 2002 bond amounts.</title>
<headline>Hypotekbanken increases 2005, 2002 bond amounts.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish borrower Hypotekbanken has raised the amounts on two existing bonds, arranger Gudme Raaschou said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the four percent bond due in 2002 was increased by 25 million crowns to 1.95 billion and its four percent 2005 was also increased by 25 million crowns, to 575 million crowns.</p>
<p>Both bonds were sold, it added. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
